    <h1 id="direct-communication-protocols-for-ai-agents-step-by-step" tabindex="-1">Direct communication protocols for AI agents: step-by-step</h1>
<p><img src="https://csuxjmfbwmkxiegfpljm.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/organization-24002/1776512343450_Engineer-working-on-AI-protocol-at-workstation.jpeg" alt="Engineer working on AI protocol at workstation"></p>
